{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"c86f5df8039bff180b30f161b001a02070b2d657ec77cef9e9c3b3a8f61a84c4","ja":"それぞれの演出","zh":"各自的演出","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"66f72c2d1c931bd14eb1146d5287852e73964cf52e7e3fcc355204d9bcde75e5","ja":"「所恵美さん、素晴らしい一体感でした！\nそれでは、次は桜守歌織さんです！　どうぞ！」","zh":"「所惠美，配合得太棒了！\n接下来是樱守歌织！请吧！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"05764279b7150ddc6d93c43b168349e83733ef27d56a2749095921b29f197278","ja":"私は、ピアノを演奏しながら歌いたいと思います。\nどうぞ、リラックスして聞いてください♪","zh":"我想一边弹钢琴一边唱歌。\n请放松心情聆听♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"80ed4f1d2054f13eda00f958c90290ea1722b1c1a6c5b102a2ba59aa45e5c998","ja":"ピアノの弾き語りか～。\nそういえばスタジオのセットにピアノあったね！","zh":"钢琴自弹自唱啊～。\n说起来，摄影棚的布景里有钢琴来着！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3b84257c585fb823f0287abf209bbc435ecff0b4307439e4c96a532a6197d651","ja":"優しい音色と歌声に、心がいやされますね。\n観客のみなさんも、うっとり聞きほれちゃってますよ。","zh":"温柔的音色和歌声，治愈人心呢。\n观众们也都听得如痴如醉了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1de0c372e0e8dab9004d6a16f266ddcb13f0c7ce9a957d6282c8e1c65de3f796","ja":"スタッフさんと何か話してたのはこれだったんだね～。\nいいなー、私も楽器を使わせてもらえばよかったかも！","zh":"原来你和工作人员聊的是这个呀～。\n真好～我也该借件乐器来用用的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f49c64b447446b48b13e150ed32db0d1f53c12bf197358e6ff5ba14a6a20c0ea","ja":"「桜守歌織さん、ありがとうございました！\n続いては……ジュリアさんの登場です！」","zh":"「樱守歌织，谢谢您！\n接下来……有请茱莉亚登场！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"5b4e22aba9f4a421401736e6d425b2c86581373b26712f8201e979d7f19c84c5","ja":"カオリに先を越されちまったのは残念だけど……。\n弾き語りなら、あたしも負けないよ！","zh":"被歌织抢先了，真遗憾……。\n要说自弹自唱，我也不会输！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e47a3c5e944a324501e5889537c1f06571d26853ab57b87a956d871de8687b50","ja":"さあ、みんな！\nあたしのロックで、とびっきり熱く盛り上がりな！","zh":"来吧，大家！\n跟着我的摇滚，尽情嗨起来吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"f6bd0bd28df8da63f85c65dcd8e0e6a618496aa1e69f2bbc034334e5521d43f4","ja":"ロックアレンジ……！　すごいわ、\n同じ曲なのに、まるで違う曲みたい……。","zh":"摇滚编曲……！好厉害，  \n明明是同一首歌，却像完全不同的歌……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"0928daee4abe56b1b9a546c54e474cef41ab379d9b70397816ea504546f31464","ja":"アコースティックギターでの弾き語りで熱唱！\n熱すぎます～！！　さすがはジュリアちゃんですね！","zh":"用木吉他自弹自唱，激情高歌！\n太热烈了～！！果然是茱莉亚呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"ae02f6dc5fd112bd744cff5fb87cbe2ecbc41cd94540bb8ce333f8e134e135f9","ja":"会場のみんなも席を立って大盛り上がりだよ！\nこれは、誰が1位になるかわからなくなってきたね！","zh":"会场的大家也都站了起来，气氛热烈！\n现在谁能拿下第1名，还说不准了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"d6c270f65dfbbc088ad5c037768a305ca7672fd3f8a06f4ee56368cc9e1c2053","ja":"「それでは4人目、北上麗花さんの登場です！\nよろしくお願いします！」","zh":"「接下来，第4位，北上丽花登场！\n请多关照！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"21091dee78c6aa1c15b498c703b5df55fbe6375c46385e8c62133c7c7016212c","ja":"はーい。私は、楽曲をオペラ風にアレンジしました。\n原曲とはまた違う味わいを楽しんでくださいね～！","zh":"好的。我将乐曲改编成了歌剧风格。\n请品味与原曲别具一格的韵味～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"a885c65bfb25ae21b7b05e8e31998c6f06e4a31f21f4f69e54737972fc00b93b","ja":"うわ、すご……あんな短時間で、よくこんなに\nしっかりオペラ風に仕上げられたね。","zh":"哇，太厉害了……这么短的时间，竟然能把这个做得这么\n像歌剧一样完成呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"9ca6a58dc193d6f79d7685ce2aad0f5305d32c856fd5bd52b116601dbfc24c60","ja":"オペラ歌唱は難しいってのに、\nあんなにのびのび歌って……さすがだな、レイは。","zh":"歌剧演唱明明很难，\n却能唱得那么自在……不愧是丽花啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1829.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"d9e3ec17c3c448c29869d709620fea32596327c93a5be1c624091af4063169ea","ja":"やっぱり麗花ちゃんの歌声ってすごいわね。\nみんな圧倒されて心をつかまれちゃってるみたい……。","zh":"果然小丽花的歌声真是了不起呢。\n大家似乎都被折服了，心也被俘获了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
